  <!--
    Not compiled on Linux (serialization):
    - Util/FastSerializer.cs, Util/7BitEncodedInts.cs: an unused NRefactory-era binary object serializer built on
      formatter-based serialization (FormatterServices, ISerializable; SYSLIB0050), which the port forbids (ADR 0009, 0018).
  -->

  <!--
    Not compiled on Linux (completion extras):
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp.Completion/CompletionProvider/*: MonoDevelop's additional Roslyn completion providers (cast, delegate
      and lambda creation, enum members, event sender cast, string format items, preprocessor, Apple protocol members)
      derive from CommonCompletionProvider, whose Roslyn 4+ contract (internal Language and option-based overloads, sealed
      public trigger) cannot be implemented outside Roslyn. Roslyn 5.9's own C# providers remain (symbols, keywords, enum
      and completion-list members, preprocessor symbols, overrides, named parameters, XML docs, snippets).
  -->

  <!--
    Not compiled on Linux (editor integration and removed Roslyn services):
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp/CSharpPathedDocumentExtension{,.DataProvider,Provider}.cs,
      MonoDevelop.CSharp.ClassOutline/CSharpOutlineTextEditorExtensionProvider.cs, MonoDevelop.CSharp.Refactoring/CommandArgsFactories.cs,
      MonoDevelop.CSharp.Debugger/RoslynDebugInfoProvider.cs: integration with the Cocoa/WPF MonoDevelop.TextEditor add-in
      (ITextView content providers, command mapping, VS text view debugger tooltips), excluded by ADR 0012. The GTK editor
      uses PathedDocumentTextEditorExtension, CSharpOutlineTextEditorExtension and the IDebuggerExpressionResolver of the
      completion extension.
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp.Resolver/{CSharpLanguageDebugInfoService,DataTipInfoGetter,LocationInfoGetter}.cs: copies of Roslyn
      EditorFeatures code; Roslyn 5.9 Features ships CSharpLanguageDebugInfoService (ILanguageDebugInfoService), used instead.
    - MonoDevelop.Ide.Completion.Presentation/*: contained-language (projection) documents for ASP.NET/Razor pages, which
      are excluded on Linux (ADR 0017); Roslyn's default IHostDependentFormattingRuleFactoryService applies.
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp.OptionProvider/{CSharpDocumentOptionsProvider,OptionProviderFactory,StyleViewModel}.cs: Roslyn 4+
      removed IDocumentOptionsProvider(Factory) and the OptionSet-based code style page (see MonoDevelop.Refactoring);
      the C# formatting policy is passed explicitly where MonoDevelop formats (CSharpFormatter, RoslynFormattingService).
  -->

  <!--
    Not compiled on Linux (moved, NRefactory, unit testing):
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp.Project/{CSharpCompilerParameters,CSharpResourceIdBuilder,CSharpProjectExtension,
      PortableCSharpProjectFlavor,CSharpLanguageVersionHelper}.cs, MonoDevelop.CSharp/CSharpBindingCompilerManager.cs:
      compiled by MonoDevelop.CSharpBinding.Core (T053), which this add-in depends on.
    - MonoDevelop.CSharp/CSharpEnhancedCodeProvider.cs: CodeDOM provider on NRefactory (ADR 0019); CSharpBinding.Core
      registers System.CodeDom's CSharpCodeProvider for C#.
  -->

